OL,3,AJapan beer giants raided over alleged
OL,4,Aprice-fixing cartel
OL,5,
OL,6,FJapanese officials have raided the
OL,7,Fcountry's biggest beer makers over
OL,8,Fallegations they worked together to
OL,9,Fraise the price of their beverages.
OL,11,FAsahi, Kirin and Suntory Spirits
OL,12,Fconfirmed to the BBC their premises had
OL,13,Fbeen searched by the Japan Fair Trade
OL,14,FCommission, adding that they would
OL,15,Ffully cooperate with the government
OL,16,Fauthority.
OL,18,FThere are reports Sapporo Breweries was
OL,19,Falso raided. The firm has been
OL,20,Fcontacted for comment.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
