OL,3,AJapan beer giants raided over alleged
OL,4,Aprice-fixing cartel
OL,5,
OL,6,FAsahi, Kirin and Sapporo all saw their
OL,7,Fshare price fall after news of the
OL,8,Finvestigation broke on Wednesday.
OL,9,FSuntory is not publicly-listed.
